# Push updates to GitHub

After each update to this shop, commit the change and push it to `main` on https://github.com/chrins63/jawabu-beauty-shop.

- Do this when the requested change is finished, including the files for that update.
- Leave out secrets: `.env` files, keys, and credentials.
- Do not force-push `main`.
- If GitHub sign-in is missing, stop and ask the user to sign in before pushing.
